function renderHomeLessons(){const preferred=['常用口語表達','飲食與餐廳','交通與旅行','購物與付款','居家生活'];const picks=[];for(const topic of preferred){const l=lessons.find(x=>x.stageIndex===0&&x.topic===topic);if(l&&!picks.some(x=>x.topic===topic))picks.push(l);if(picks.length===3)break}for(const l of lessons){if(picks.length>=3)break;if(l.stageIndex===0&&!picks.some(x=>x.topic===l.topic))picks.push(l)}$('homeLessons').innerHTML=picks.map(l=>{const title=state.ui==='en'?l.en:state.ui==='bi'?`${l.title} · ${l.en}`:l.title;const desc=state.ui==='en'?l.descEn:state.ui==='bi'?`${l.desc}\n${l.descEn}`:l.desc;return `<article class="lesson card"><div class="lesson-art ${l.art}">${l.icon}</div><h3>${safe(title)}</h3><p class="${state.ui==='bi'?'langline':''}">${safe(desc)}</p><div class="lesson-meta"><span>◷ ${l.duration}</span><button class="text-link" onclick="openLesson('${l.id}')">開始學習 →</button></div></article>`}).join('');const pending=words.filter(w=>wordProgress(w.id).review||wordProgress(w.id).wrong>0).slice(0,3);$('homeReview').innerHTML=pending.length?pending.map(w=>`<div class="word-row"><div class="hanzi">${safe(w.zh)}</div><div class="word-info"><b>${safe(w.en)}</b><small>${safe(w.py)}</small></div><button class="round-btn" title="${t('speak')}" onclick="speak('${w.id}')">🔊</button></div>`).join(''):`<div class="empty">${t('no_review')}</div>`}
let currentLesson=lessons[0]?.id||'';function openLesson(id){currentLesson=id;state.lessonIndex=0;state.lessonWords=lessons.find(l=>l.id===id)?.words||lessons[0].words;go('lesson')};function startLesson(){openLesson(lessons[0]?.id||'')}
function renderLesson(){const lesson=lessons.find(l=>l.id===currentLesson)||lessons[0];if(!lesson)return;const list=state.lessonWords.length?state.lessonWords:lesson.words;const countEl=$('lessonContentsCount');if(countEl)countEl.textContent=list.length;const idx=Math.min(state.lessonIndex,list.length-1);const w=words.find(w=>w.id===list[idx])||words[0];const stage=CURRICULUM_STAGES[lesson.stageIndex]||CURRICULUM_STAGES[0];const heading=$('lessonPageHeading'),descEl=$('lessonPageDesc'),badge=$('lessonStageBadge');if(heading)heading.textContent=state.ui==='en'?lesson.en:state.ui==='bi'?`${lesson.title}\n${lesson.en}`:lesson.title;if(descEl)descEl.textContent=state.ui==='en'?lesson.descEn:state.ui==='bi'?`${lesson.desc}\n${lesson.descEn}`:lesson.desc;if(badge)badge.textContent=`${lesson.stageIndex+1}/8 · ${stage.name}`;const globalTitle=$('pageTitle');if(globalTitle&&$('view-lesson')?.classList.contains('active')){globalTitle.textContent=state.ui==='en'?lesson.en:lesson.title;syncDuplicatePageHeading()}$('lessonStepLabel').textContent=`${t('word').toUpperCase()} ${idx+1} / ${list.length}`;$('lessonTopic').textContent=state.ui==='en'?lesson.en:state.ui==='bi'?lesson.title+' · '+lesson.en:lesson.topic;$('lessonStepBar').style.width=((idx+1)/list.length*100)+'%';const p=wordProgress(w.id);$('lessonWord').innerHTML=`<div class="big-word"><div class="hanzi">${safe(w.zh)}</div><div class="pinyin">${safe(w.py)}</div><div class="english">${safe(w.en)}</div><button class="btn btn-soft" style="margin-top:16px" onclick="speak('${w.id}')">🔊 ${t('speak')}</button></div><div class="example-box"><div class="tiny muted" style="margin-bottom:8px">${t('example')}</div><div class="zh">${safe(w.ex)}</div>${w.expy?`<div class="py">${safe(w.expy)}</div>`:''}<div class="en">${safe(w.exen)}</div><button type="button" class="btn btn-soft sentence-audio-btn" style="margin-top:12px" title="${safe(t('example_play'))}" onclick="speakExample('${w.id}')">🔊 ${safe(t('example_play'))}</button></div><div class="tiny muted" style="margin:0 0 20px">${t('meaning')}: ${safe(w.en)} · ${safe(w.pos)}<br>平台建議階段：${safe(stage.name)}（非官方級別） · 詞條 ID：${safe(w.uid)}</div>`;$('prevWord').disabled=idx===0;$('nextWord').innerHTML=idx===list.length-1?`${t('done')} ✓`:`${t('next_word')} →`;$('lessonSideList').innerHTML=list.map((id,i)=>{const x=words.find(w=>w.id===id);if(!x)return '';return `<div class="side-item ${i===idx?'current':''}" onclick="jumpWord(${i})" style="cursor:pointer"><span>${i<idx?'✓':i+1}</span><div><b>${safe(x.zh)}</b><div class="muted" style="font-size:10px;margin-top:3px">${safe(x.en)}</div></div></div>`}).join('')}
function stepLesson(delta){const list=state.lessonWords.length?state.lessonWords:(lessons.find(l=>l.id===currentLesson)||lessons[0]).words;const w=words.find(w=>w.id===list[state.lessonIndex]);if(w&&delta>0)markSeen(w.id);if(state.lessonIndex+delta<0)return;if(state.lessonIndex+delta>=list.length){const finished=lessons.find(l=>l.id===currentLesson)||lessons[0],old=state.courseProgress[currentLesson]||{};state.courseProgress[currentLesson]={completed:true,completedAt:today(),attempts:(old.attempts||0)+1,studiedWords:list.length,stageIndex:finished.stageIndex,topic:finished.topic};activity({kind:'lesson',lessonId:currentLesson});save();renderCurriculum();toast(t('lesson_finished'));startQuiz(false);go('practice');return;}state.lessonIndex+=delta;renderLesson();save()}function jumpWord(i){const list=state.lessonWords.length?state.lessonWords:(lessons.find(l=>l.id===currentLesson)||lessons[0]).words;const old=words.find(w=>w.id===list[state.lessonIndex]);if(old)markSeen(old.id);state.lessonIndex=i;renderLesson()}
